## Original Content
U.S. natural gas futures fell after weekend updates took some of the chill out of early February weather forecasts.

## Summary
U.S. natural gas futures decreased due to weekend weather forecast updates that indicated a milder start to February. The shift to less cold predictions reduced market expectations and caused price drops.

## Key Points
- U.S. natural gas futures fell in response to forecast changes.
- Weekend updates revealed a milder weather outlook for early February.
- This adjustment in forecasts influenced natural gas market dynamics.


